{"ticker":"CL","updated":"2026-10-23T22:46:30Z","profile":{"longName":"Colgate-Palmolive Company","shortName":"Colgate-Palmolive Company","sector":"Consumer Defensive","industry":"Household & Personal Products","country":"United States","website":"https://www.colgatepalmolive.com","fullTimeEmployees":33600,"marketCap":74966130688,"trailingPE":37.023624,"forwardPE":23.008528,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":3.561844,"pegRatio":1.77,"targetMeanPrice":98.15,"targetHighPrice":110.0,"targetLowPrice":87.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":20,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.049,"earningsGrowth":-0.055,"grossMargins":0.60431,"operatingMargins":0.20966,"profitMargins":0.096829996,"totalRevenue":21046999040,"beta":0.322,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":99.33,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":74.55,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":2.18},"summary":"Colgate-Palmolive Company, together with its subsidiaries, manufactures and sells consumer products in the United States and internationally. It operates through two segments: Oral, Personal and Home Care; and Pet Nutrition. The Oral, Personal and Home Care segment offers toothpaste, toothbrushes, mouthwash, bar and liquid hand soaps, shower gels, shampoos, conditioners, deodorants and antiperspirants, skin health products, dishwashing detergents, fabric conditioners, household cleaners, and other related items. This segment markets and sells its products under the Colgate, Palmolive, Darlie, elmex, hello, meridol, Sorriso, Tom's of Maine, EltaMD, Filorga, Irish Spring, Lady Speed Stick, PCA SKIN, Protex, Sanex, Softsoap, Speed Stick, Ajax, Axion, Fabuloso, Murphy, Soupline, and Suavitel brands to a range of traditional and eCommerce retailers, wholesalers, and distributors, as well as dentists and skin health professionals. It also offers pharmaceutical products for dentists and other oral health professionals. The Pet Nutrition segment offers pet nutrition products for everyday nutritional needs under the Hill's Science Diet brand; and a range of therapeutic pet products to help nutritionally support dogs and cats in different stages of health under the Hill's Prescription Diet brand; and a fresh pet food sold to pet specialty and other retailers in Australia under Prime100 b","summary_zh":"高露潔棕欖公司及其子公司在美國和國際上生產和銷售消費品。它透過兩個部門運作：口腔護理、個人護理和家庭護理；和寵物營養。口腔、個人和家庭護理部門提供牙膏、牙刷、漱口水、皂條和洗手液、沐浴露、洗髮精、護髮素、除臭劑和止汗劑、皮膚保健產品、餐具洗滌劑、織物調理劑、家用清潔劑和其他相關產品。該部門以 Colgate、Palmolive、Darlie、elmex、hello、meridol、Sorriso、Tom's of Maine、EltaMD、Filorga、Irish Spring、Lady Speed Stick、PCA SKIN、Protex、Sanex、Softsoap、Speed Stick、Ajax、Axion、FabulSo、Murphy、FabulSotel、Fabon品牌向一系列傳統和電子商務零售商、批發商和消費者行銷和銷售其產品。經銷商以及牙醫和皮膚健康專業人士。它還為牙醫和其他口腔健康專業人員提供藥物。寵物營養部門以 Hill's Science Diet 品牌提供滿足日常營養需求的寵物營養產品；以及 Hill's Prescription Diet 品牌下的一系列治療性寵物產品，可為處於不同健康階段的狗和貓提供營養支持；以及以 Prime100 b 名義出售給澳大利亞寵物專賣寵物店和其他零售商的新鮮食品","sector_zh":"消費者防禦","industry_zh":"居家及個人產品","candles":[{"t":"2025-08-25","o":85.82,"h":86.0,"l":84.0,"c":84.06,"v":4481900},{"t":"2025-08-26","o":84.0,"h":84.84,"l":83.85,"c":84.14,"v":6163100},{"t":"2025-08-27","o":84.15,"h":84.46,"l":83.77,"c":84.45,"v":4196700},{"t":"2025-08-28","o":84.28,"h":84.68,"l":83.22,"c":83.42,"v":5321500},{"t":"2025-08-29","o":83.63,"h":84.3,"l":83.22,"c":84.07,"v":3934700},{"t":"2025-09-02","o":84.18,"h":84.59,"l":83.58,"c":84.39,"v":5288500},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":84.52,"h":84.75,"l":82.65,"c":83.81,"v":5048000},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":84.1,"h":84.1,"l":83.02,"c":83.67,"v":6202400},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":83.47,"h":85.76,"l":83.12,"c":85.13,"v":6165400},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":84.92,"h":85.08,"l":83.97,"c":84.19,"v":3975800},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":84.07,"h":84.69,"l":83.8,"c":84.28,"v":3585200},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":83.71,"h":84.09,"l":82.29,"c":83.2,"v":4406000},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":83.38,"h":84.3,"l":83.25,"c":84.06,"v":3362300},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":83.75,"h":84.54,"l":83.27,"c":83.28,"v":3169100},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":83.21,"h":83.74,"l":81.6,"c":82.13,"v":6605800},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":82.35,"h":82.58,"l":8